{"version":1,"key":"card:486","content":{"id":486,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"264fd46a-2a28-469f-8920-13b951a301d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Rust 作为强静态类型语言，必须在编译时就知道所有变量的类型。最简单的办法在声明变量的同时指定其类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"db92e771-afb6-428f-8678-b02d20f34aaa","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ae160546-ef68-479f-8b37-6de5f554caa6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn main() {\n    let i: i32 = -1;\n    let u: u32 = 2;\n\n    println!(\"{} {}\", i, u);\n}","collabId":"d8e0339d-31e9-4db4-b369-dee065c575fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"6773f1c8-eb6a-4076-8f51-a77c5bb270b0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"60c39d3f-f3b0-4df9-ac67-09590b549a36","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn main() {\n    let i = 1_i32; // i32\n    let u = 2_u32; // u32\n\n    println!(\"{} {}\", i, u);\n}","collabId":"8ea2ecab-40d5-463e-be0f-179323a09c2d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d621cdc1-456a-4f7e-805f-d5e58e216117","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这样略显繁琐，好在大部分情况下不需要手动指定类型，Rust 编译器可根据值自动推断出变量类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"30fb75de-ec28-4f77-8120-dd80c9fc0687","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a5411ccd-ec31-4705-bff7-0740594ac3cd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"struct Point {\n    x: i32,\n    y: i32,\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    // let p: Point = Point {x: 1, y: }\n    let p = Point { x: 1, y: 2 }; // Point\n}","collabId":"d1f440f9-b2c9-4bee-b1da-1fa47a5f316c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"998a7a3d-8979-452e-8bd9-c5ec1c1acc20","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0b6fd40e-2e8e-46be-9c30-637bcfb9ad65","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于数字类型，如果没有显示标注类型，也无法根据其上下文确定其类型，那么整数默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"i32"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，浮点数默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"f64"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7796eb70-b508-4851-9507-293abc25ee51","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更神奇的是，Rust 可以根据变量的使用来确定变量的类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"d701e64e-a4e8-400b-82a5-86f450354219","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"361e28a0-a167-43d4-9f24-6e930623578e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn sum(a: u32, b: u32) -> u32 {\n    a + b\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let a = 1; // u32\n    let b = 2; // u32\n    println!(\"{}\", sum(a, b));\n}","collabId":"08480351-9901-4822-a8cc-c468f5d91701","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4c7b679e-2840-447d-85f1-56c074dac231","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"b"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 定义未声明类型，但是由于它们是作为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sum"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数的参数使用，而其参数声明的类型是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"u32"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以二者的类型被推导为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"u32"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 了。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"8b821b42-522e-400e-bb11-fdbdb29ac344","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"12c5646f-c7a1-49d7-a9e4-18b70f545fd1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn main() {\n    let mut vec: Vec<u32> = vec![];\n    let a = 1;\n    let b = 2;\n    \n    vec.push(a);\n    vec.push(b);\n}","collabId":"78b47752-a0c3-4575-8fd5-33a9e8b15b9e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2c24be56-79d7-4db9-85da-15a3665a2b4a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"b"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 同样在定义时未声明类型，但是它们后面被插入到了类型为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Vec<u32>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的向量中，于是它们的类型就被推导为了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"u32"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9b677c50-a1df-4a43-82d9-68fe1da632fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果无法根据上下文确定其类型，那么变量在声明时一定要标注类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"da01d387-0514-485c-ba98-7c8938f1d68b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0c54672e-17a2-49a9-9a41-c92cae43e1b1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn main() {\n    let str_num = \"32\";\n\n    let num = str_num.parse().unwrap();\n\n    println!(\"{}\", num);\n}","collabId":"a29fc3a9-5295-4b71-9ec3-5f5e4345b56c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"b652fcf7-6632-4062-b542-af130fc1d474","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"af084d7a-496c-4480-93ca-e803f21032f0","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let num = str_num.parse().unwrap();\n    ^^^           ----- type must be known at this point\n  = note: cannot satisfy `<_ as FromStr>::Err == _`\nhelp: consider giving `num` an explicit type\n\nlet num: /* Type */ = str_num.parse().unwrap();","collabId":"fa2b7d52-39d9-449b-b06b-6c0cfa38a6ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"808aecc0-c3b7-4975-a47e-a45fb090574d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述将一个字符串转化为数字，Rust 编译器无法推导其类型，需要显示的标注，对于上述程序有两种办法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"15891e00-0bb3-4934-b377-9213d2696c80","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d084d417-8d20-4097-ba5f-8b9ea41138d3","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let num: u32 = str_num.parse().unwrap();","collabId":"336d0abc-6d07-44fb-87be-21fb36d867ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"72243fb1-b73c-4c49-b139-810ab1be6655","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ba6fae76-0235-43ef-ba4b-2e0e1273cdf1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let num = str_num.parse::<u32>().unwrap();","collabId":"e50b1ea3-4dd5-403a-b1f5-dbe9098ae29e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Rust"],"createTime":1721091346443,"updateTime":1755938841137,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755938841137}}